   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>A forward biased safe operating area (FBSOA) curve for BJT is shown in figure. Which of the boundary in the curve decides the secondary breakdown limit?</p>\n\n<div> </div>\n\n<div><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/12/126f7fec7aff2053b588.png\" /></div>",
   "options": [
    {
